  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&bull; Brand Introduction:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">AURACUBE is a forward-thinking brand that redefines lighting solutions by blending aesthetics with functionality. We are passionate about creating products that inspire cozy and elegant living spaces. At AURACUBE, we prioritize innovation, quality, and user experience, offering our customers unique lighting designs that bring warmth and beauty to every home.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&bull; Product Description:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">The <strong>AURACUBE Water Ripple Ambient Night Light</strong> is an eye-catching, multifunctional table lamp that transforms any space into a serene oasis. Its rotating water ripple light projection creates dynamic, colorful effects that mimic water reflections, adding a touch of luxury and relaxation to any room. With 16 light colors and remote control functionality, it&rsquo;s perfect for setting the mood, whether for relaxation, romantic evenings, or creative inspiration.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>Dynamic Water Ripple Effect:</strong> Creates a mesmerizing water ripple ambiance for a tranquil environment.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>16 Light Colors:</strong> Customize your lighting experience with multiple color options and brightness settings.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>Modern, Compact Design:</strong> Fits effortlessly into any room, enhancing its style and atmosphere.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>Remote Control Convenience:</strong> Easily control light settings from a distance for maximum comfort.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>Energy-Efficient LED Technology:</strong> Eco-friendly and long-lasting, with minimal power consumption.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&bull; Payment Terms:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Affiliates earn a <strong>10% commission</strong> on each sale referred.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Payments are processed monthly and issued via PayPal or direct transfer.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Minimum payout threshold: $50.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>&bull; Other Information:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>Marketing Materials Provided:</strong> High-quality images, promotional content, and banners will be supplied to help affiliates maximize their sales.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>24/7 Affiliate Support:</strong> Our team is always ready to a